# the screen reader (fm1-reader, announce.c): a reader listens, and each page, knob, help card, button and
# chord change is said once, in the screen's own text (the words file says it in full)
wait 200
listen
wait 100
# the page, its knobs and the header (the Dub page's first knob says the tempo)...
said . Piece Basic, F Dorian, playing
# ...then the main screen, queued: the chord, how far to the next, the section, the scale from the root up
listen
where
said % of the way. Section Full, bar 1. Scale F, G, Ab, Bb, C, D, Eb
# a page settles before it is said
tap ENV
wait 300
said Chord page, voice Saws: Level 
tap GLO
wait 300
said Setup page: Root F, Tune 0, MIDI out On, Lights On
# a knob: its name and value, once it settles
spin K2 3
wait 300
said Tune +3
spin K4 1
wait 300
said Lights Keys
spin K4 -1
wait 300
# SELECT turns the pages
turn SELECT -1
wait 300
said Space page: Echo 
# the echo times, each in its own words (the words file)
spin K2 -10
wait 300
said Echo time 1/8
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Echo time 1/8.
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Echo time 1/4
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Echo time 1/4.
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Echo time 1/2
spin K2 1
wait 300
said Echo time 1 bar
spin K1 -100
wait 300
said Echo 0
spin K3 -100
wait 300
said Feedback 0
spin K4 -100
wait 300
said Reverb 0
# the page again, as now set
tap SEQ
wait 300
said Drums page, kit Tight: Level 
tap FX
wait 300
said Space page: Echo 0, Echo time 1 bar, Feedback 0, Reverb 0
tap HOME
wait 300
said Dub page
# Drift in bars
spin K4 -20
wait 300
said Drift 2 bars
spin K1 -100
wait 300
said Tempo 90
# HOME + SELECT: the tempo (the Dub page's first knob says it)
press HOME
turn SELECT 2 200
release HOME
wait 300
said Tempo 92
# the keys: a note out of the scale and back in; the root stays
tapkey w1
said REMOVED G
tapkey w1
said ADDED G
tapkey b3
said ADDED C#
tapkey b3
said REMOVED C#
tapkey w0
said THE ROOT STAYS (SETUP)
# the encoders: the mode, the piece (with its key and tempo)
turn ALGO 1
said MODE Phrygian
turn ALGO -1
said MODE Dorian
turn PRESET 1
said PIECE Chamber, A Aeolian, tempo 
wait 300
said_none Level
turn PRESET -1
said PIECE Basic, F Dorian, tempo 92
wait 300
# the buttons' messages, said once
tap REC
said DUB HOLD ON
# the main screen says it is held
where
said , dub hold. Section 
tap REC
said DUB HOLD OFF
tap PLAY
said RESTING
wait 300
said_none PLAYING
tap PLAY
said PLAYING
wait 300
said_none RESTING
tap OCT+
said PING OCTAVE +1
tap OCT-
said PING OCTAVE 0
press EDIT
wait 600
release EDIT
said NEXT CHORD ON THE BAR
# a help card: its button, then its lines
press SAVE
wait 1000
said SAVE button. SAVES ALL EIGHT PIECES. KEEP HOLDING: THE PIECE BACK TO ITS RECIPE
release SAVE
tap SAVE
said SAVED
press REC
wait 1000
said EFFECTS GRID. White keys: Throw, Time x2, Tape stop, Swell; Low-pass
release REC
wait 100
# the chord moving by itself (every two bars now): queued (said after what is being said)
wait 8000
said Chord
# a MIDI clock arriving, and start / stop from it
midi FA 00 00
midi F8 00 00
wait 20
said Tempo EXT
midi FC 00 00
wait 300
said RESTING
wait 1000
said Tempo 92
# Drift Hold, and Evolve and Motion to known values
spin K4 20
wait 300
said Drift Hold
spin K2 -100
wait 300
said Evolve 0
spin K3 100
wait 300
said Motion 100
# WHERE: everything again (the chord held now)
where
said Dub page: Tempo 92, Evolve 0, Motion 100, Drift Hold. Piece Basic, F Dorian, resting
where
said , held. Section 
